@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-02
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-02 Requirement layers\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nmethod goals, protocol CRS and tool requirements stay distinct

package "Method goals" as MG {
  [CL-RQ1 loop consistency]
  [CL-RQ2 comparative effect]
  [CL-RQ3 uncertainty and stopping]
}

package "Protocol CRS" as PCRS {
  [INFORMATION]
  [UPLOAD]
  [Media Defined DOWNLOAD]
  [Operator Defined DOWNLOAD]
  [FIND]
  [abort / reject / exception / retry]
}

package "Tool requirements" as TR {
  [later development-ready PR]
  [not this increment]
}

MG ..> PCRS : method uses protocol obligations
PCRS ..> TR : tool may later implement
note right of TR
  Do not mix the three layers into one CRS.
  New protocol rows wait for source-unit audit.
end note
@enduml
